<title>USA: Penn Power &amp; Light may set preferred deal.</title>
<headline>Penn Power &amp; Light may set preferred deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennsylvania Power &amp; Light Co is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with an offering of 4.0 million trust originated preferred securities to raise $100 million, syndicate sources said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal will consist of $25 TOPRS due 2027 and is expected to be launched today via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, the sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
